```

### Development Setup
```bash
# Add dependencies
uv add minio asyncpg "sqlalchemy[asyncio]" alembic

# Create .env file
cp .env.example .env
# Edit .env with your PostgreSQL credentials

# Run database migrations
uv run alembic upgrade head

