```
User → UI → NGINX → Orchestrator
                        ↓
                   LangGraph Agent
                   (Query Analysis)
                        ↓
                   ┌────┴────┐
                   │         │
              Need RAG?   No (Direct)
                   │         │
                  Yes        └──────────┐
                   │                    │
                   ↓                    │
              Embed Query               │
                   ↓                    │
              Qdrant (Retrieve)         │
                   ↓                    │
